{"name":"Coffee Cake","hex":"#b5987f","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"coffee cake","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any cake flavored with coffee.","Any cake meant to be eaten with coffee; often a babka or a streusel-topped cake (crumb cake)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/coffee_cake"}],"entries":[{"title":"Coffee cake (American)","blocks":[{"text":"Coffee cake or coffeecake is a sweet bread common in the United States, so called because it is typically served with coffee. Leavenings can include yeast, baking soda, or baking powder. The modern dish typically contains no coffee. Outside North America, the term is generally understood to mean a cake flavored with coffee."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/Coffee_cake_%28Unsplash%29.jpg/330px-Coffee_cake_%28Unsplash%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee_cake_(American)"},{"title":"Coffee and walnut cake","blocks":[{"text":"Coffee and walnut cake is a sponge cake flavoured with coffee and walnuts."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/-2016-02-18_Coffee_%26_Walnut_cake%2C_Trimingham.JPG/330px--2016-02-18_Coffee_%26_Walnut_cake%2C_Trimingham.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee_and_walnut_cake"},{"title":"Coffee","blocks":[{"text":"Coffee is a beverage brewed from roasted, ground coffee beans. Dark-colored and bitter, coffee has a stimulating effect on humans due to its caffeine content; however decaffeinated coffee is also commercially available. There are also various coffee substitutes."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Latte_and_dark_coffee.jpg/330px-Latte_and_dark_coffee.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee"},{"title":"Cake","blocks":[{"text":"Cake is a baker's confectionery made by combining flour with a liquid, a fat or both, and usually with a leavening agent. Cakes are usually baked, but can be griddled. In their oldest forms, cakes were modifications of bread, but cakes now cover a wide range of preparations that can be simple or elaborate and which share features with other desserts such as pastries, meringues, custards, and pies."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Pound_layer_cake.jpg/330px-Pound_layer_cake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cake"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Cranberry_Coffee_Cake%2C_October_2009.jpg/250px-Cranberry_Coffee_Cake%2C_October_2009.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Cranberry_Coffee_Cake%2C_October_2009.jpg/500px-Cranberry_Coffee_Cake%2C_October_2009.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Cranberry_Coffee_Cake%2C_October_2009.jpg/250px-Cranberry_Coffee_Cake%2C_October_2009.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACranberry_Coffee_Cake%2C_October_2009.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Drakes-Coffee-Cake.jpg/250px-Drakes-Coffee-Cake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Drakes-Coffee-Cake.jpg/500px-Drakes-Coffee-Cake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Drakes-Coffee-Cake.jpg/250px-Drakes-Coffee-Cake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnai